=== Wisps {{dlc+|r}} ===
[[file:Familiar_Wisp.png|18px|link=]]

Wisps are temporary orbital familiars that are mostly associated with {{c|Bethany}}. By default, they orbit Isaac, blocking shots and dealing contact damage. They also fire [[spectral tears]] that deal 1.6-2.4 damage. Normal wisps have 2 health. There are many variants of wisps, most of which can be spawned randomly or through combinations with {{I|Book of Virtues}}. See ''[[Book of Virtues#Combinations|here]]'' for a full list of wisps.

Other unique variants of wisps include item wisps from {{I|Lemegeton}} which only mimic the effects of [[passive item]]s while alive, and red wisps from {{I|Vengeful Spirit}}, which are invulnerable, but disappear upon entering a new floor.
