=== Ghosts {{dlc+|r}} ===
Ghosts are temporary familiars that are summoned by various items. Most ghosts (except those created by {{i|Vade Retro}}) will automatically attack enemies after being summoned, quickly homing in on nearby enemies. All ghosts attack enemies by exploding, though some also deal contact damage shortly before doing so. Explosions from ghosts do not damage terrain or hurt Isaac. Unlike other temporary familiars, ghosts do not persist across rooms.
