'''Pretty Fly'''
* A maximum of three '''Pretty Flies''' can orbit around Isaac.
** {{i|Cube of Meat}}, {{i|Ball of Bandages}}, {{i|Sworn Protector}}, {{i|Guardian Angel}}, {{i|Smart Fly}}, {{i|Sacrificial Dagger}}, and {{i|Slipped Rib}} take up a Pretty Fly slot. These familiars are not affected by the Pretty Fly cap of 3.
** If Isaac has three Pretty Flies and picks up a {{I|Cube of Meat}}, the Cube of Meat will replace one of the flies.
** The amount of Pretty Flies Isaac has is stored. If a Pretty Fly is replaced by a Cube of Meat but then that Cube of Meat is removed, the replaced Pretty Fly will return. If Isaac has more than 3 Pretty Flies and one of his current Pretty Flies is removed through {{i|Sacrificial Altar}}, then another will replace it.

'''Orbital Rings'''
* There are set orbit rings that have specific rotations and distance from Isaac.
** {{dlc+|a}} If two orbitals share a same orbit ring they will be positioned opposite each other (three will cause them to fly 120 degrees apart, four will fly at 90 degrees etc.).{{dlc-}}
* Ring 1 flies counter-clockwise and is the closest to Isaac.
** It consists of Pretty Flies and familiars that can replace Pretty Flies.
*** {{i|Guardian Angel}} will increase the rotation speed of all familiars in this ring.
* Ring 2 flies counter-clockwise and is second closest.
** It consists of {{i|Bloodshot Eye}}, {{i|Big Fan}}, {{i|Guillotine}}, {{i|Leprosy}}, and {{i|Mom's Razor}}
*** {{i|Big Fan}} will decrease the rotation speed of all familiars in this ring and ring 1. It will also override {{i|Guardian Angel}}'s speed boost.
*** {{dlc|r}} A Pretty Fly [[Horse Pill]] will spawn a unique {{i|Big Fan}} that will not orbit slower or affect the speed of other orbitals.
* Ring 3 flies counter-clockwise and orbits slightly slower than ring 2.
** It consists of {{i|Psy Fly}} and {{i|Tinytoma}}.
* Ring 4 flies clockwise at the speed of ring 3.
** It consists of {{i|Distant Admiration}} and {{i|Bot Fly}}.
* Ring 5 flies counter-clockwise even slower than ring 4.
** It consists of {{i|Friend Zone}} and {{i|Angelic Prism}}.
* Ring 6 flies counter-clockwise at the speed of ring 5.
** It consists of {{i|Forever alone}} and {{i|Best Bud}}.
*** {{i|Best Bud}} will orbit much faster than {{i|Forever alone}} but not affect the speed of the ring. However it will impact the orbiting position of other {{i|Forever alone}}s.
* {{i|The Swarm}} has a unique orbit ring between 2 and 3, it orbits counter-clockwise much slower.
* {{i|Angry Fly}} has a unique orbit ring between 3 and 4, it orbits clockwise much faster.
* Familiars affected by {{t|Friendship Necklace}} have a unique orbit ring just around ring 3. Its familiars orbit clockwise faster.

